# API Contracts for Recurring Tasks Feature

## Task Creation Endpoint
### POST /api/tasks/
**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string (LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH)",
  "tags": "string[]",
  "user_id": "integer",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "recurrence_end_date": "datetime | null",
  "recurrence_max_count": "integer | null"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "integer",
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string",
  "tags": "string[]",
  "status": "string",
  "user_id": "integer",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "recurrence_end_date": "datetime | null",
  "recurrence_max_count": "integer | null",
  "original_task_id": "integer | null",
  "occurrence_number": "integer"
}
```

## Task Update Endpoint
### PATCH /api/tasks/{task_id}
**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "title": "string | null",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string | null",
  "tags": "string[] | null",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "recurrence_end_date": "datetime | null",
  "recurrence_max_count": "integer | null"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "integer",
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string",
  "tags": "string[]",
  "status": "string",
  "user_id": "integer",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "recurrence_end_date": "datetime | null",
  "recurrence_max_count": "integer | null",
  "original_task_id": "integer | null",
  "occurrence_number": "integer"
}
```

## Task Completion Endpoint
### PATCH /api/tasks/{task_id}/complete
**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "integer",
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string",
  "tags": "string[]",
  "status": "completed",
  "user_id": "integer",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "recurrence_end_date": "datetime | null",
  "recurrence_max_count": "integer | null",
  "original_task_id": "integer | null",
  "occurrence_number": "integer"
}
```

## Kafka Message Contract
### Topic: task-events
**Message Format:**
```json
{
  "event_type": "task_completed",
  "task_id": "integer",
  "recurrence_rule": "string | null",
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string | null",
  "due_date": "datetime | null",
  "urgency": "string",
  "tags": "string[]",
  "user_id": "integer",
  "original_task_id": "integer | null",
  "occurrence_number": "integer"
}
```

## Task List Response (with recurrence indicators)
### GET /api/tasks/
**Response:**
